# ─── Round 54b: EAS upload exclusions ─────────────────────────────
# Files NOT to bundle into the tarball that EAS uploads to its build
# servers. Each excluded path saves upload bandwidth, build queue
# time, and (in some cases) avoids triggering false-positive checks
# by expo-doctor on artifact directories.
#
# Format identical to .gitignore. Anything matching is excluded.

# Local-only metro / babel caches. Regenerated on the EAS builder.
.metro-cache/
.expo/
.expo-shared/

# Web export — only relevant to localhost:3000 preview, never to a
# native EAS Android/iOS build. Including it bloated previous uploads
# by ~2-3 MB.
dist/
web-build/

# Test / coverage output
coverage/
.nyc_output/
__tests__/__snapshots__/
*.tsbuildinfo

# IDE / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Logs and editor backups
*.log
yarn-error.log
npm-debug.log*

# Memory bank / agent scratch (Emergent-specific, not part of the
# build).
memory/

# Local sandbox env files. Production env vars come from the EAS
# secrets store, NOT bundled into the build.
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
